# Reset

## Reset App State Button

* User enters "login.standardUser" into "username" field
* User enters "login.password" into "password" field
* User clicks "login" button
* User clicks "add to cart backpack" button
* User clicks "shopping cart" button
* User verifies "shopping cart badge" value is "cart.expectedCartCount"
* User verifies "cart item" text is "products.backpack"
* User saves cart badge count
* User clicks "menu" button
* User clicks "all items" button
* User clicks "menu" button
* User clicks "reset app state" button
* User clicks "shopping cart" button
* User verifies "shopping cart badge" is not displayed